#
# DS-0002 (no non-root USER): tools/build-container/Dockerfile.{rhel9,ubu2204}
# intentionally start as root. entrypoint.sh dynamically creates a user
# matching the host UID/GID (when USER_NAME/USER_UID/USER_GID are passed)
# and execs into it via `su`, defaulting to root otherwise. A static
# Dockerfile USER would break this remap.
DS-0002
